  "details": "Calling FlagDiscontinuity on the same frame as teleporting an object results in the object briefly interpolating towards the destination before snapping there. It should instead suppress the lerping entirely.\nVideo of behavior: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kd4uhF-Gq_M\nTest world: wrld_204e199e-6dd2-4ca0-99a4-f3257118f1c6\nRepro: \n1. Connect two clients\n2. With one client, click the sphere a bunch of times\n3. Observe the interpolation from the other",
